{"caption":"Paired reliability on 2,321 exposed holdout routes from 48 parents. Panel (a) shows route-weighted contrasts in percentage points (pp) with pointwise 95% family-stratified parent-cluster bootstrap intervals (9,999 resamples with A/B siblings and routes kept together). Fixed-station repair is confirmatory and scenario search is exploratory. The common 64-candidate maximum yielded 62.67 versus 20.18 mean trials. Panel (b) counts observed directions versus fixed-station repair. Equal denotes matching successes out of 10,000 and does not identify equal true probabilities.","dpi":400,"font":"DejaVu Sans","formats_sha256":{"pdf":"b9ffbdac405278ea69af6a1b0c428ccbba3360b60863e0c5b7d2c0443b470cb2","png":"ad7e9dfc8d6026b163c453f847f88ad59e72735b2646e7fbb0f1db77c0119375","svg":"b0da11975d79382ed798ff69f466e72808dab539b7a627a32ab1f22fb3c520e7"},"physical_mm":[178.0,79.0],"plot_source_sha256":"5bd96f39fa2a67b0cb232fc49d96980263efb0fc5abd9737440b56c7ef17fb40","plotted":{"effects":[{"comparator":"FSPC","equal":2050,"hi95_pp":1.6503459913289817,"higher":160,"lo95_pp":0.8630955453232267,"lower":111,"mean_pp":1.2420292977165015,"n":2321,"parent_hi95_pp":1.4686748214612724,"parent_lo95_pp":0.7901556923050246,"parent_mean_pp":1.116016839652518,"parents":48,"status":"confirmatory"},{"comparator":"SLS","equal":2042,"hi95_pp":0.49279888562577934,"higher":164,"lo95_pp":0.13338412885000206,"lower":115,"mean_pp":0.318797931925894,"n":2321,"parent_hi95_pp":0.46182621781962185,"parent_lo95_pp":0.12863789006171927,"parent_mean_pp":0.3008634295146748,"parents":48,"status":"exploratory"}],"rendered_directions":[{"count":160,"direction":"Higher","percent":6.893580353295993},{"count":2050,"direction":"Equal","percent":88.32399827660491},{"count":111,"direction":"Lower","percent":4.782421370099096}]},"source_sha256":{"results/phase3/tables/parent_effects.csv":"55b2657d9e2cba09d7aa7d34b32317b5b2a9adb086149babd0ffd1d77cfbf98f","results/phase5/data/paired_effects.csv":"d2f1581ecb85c5e422c34